cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this result, please cite it as below."
title: "Turán's pure power sum constant: C42 <= 0.68637"
abstract: >-
  A proof, with a certified computation in Arb ball arithmetic, that limsup R_n <= 0.68637 in Turán's pure power
  sum problem (Erdős problem #519; constant C42 of the Optimization Constants repository). Unrefereed; made with
  substantial help from AI models (Claude Opus 5.5 and Claude Sonnet 5.5, Anthropic).
